## Lore

About 45% of the Roane who leave their home world make their living as
professional musicians, and they are counted among the finest anywhere
in the Megaverse. A Roane Musician travels light with a rinaluo, a second
small instrument and a modest kit for the road, and can earn a meal or a
bed almost anywhere by playing for it.

The trade also makes a perfect cover. A wandering performer can drift
into town and out again without anyone wondering why, which is exactly
what a Roane spy or thief needs.

## GM Notes

Money also includes 3D6x1,000 credits in precious or tradable goods. The
conventional weapon comes with 144 rounds of ammunition.
